<p>Two trains, A and B, start simultaneously from opposite ends of a 450-mile track. Each travels nonstop at a uniform speed to the opposite end. A finishes its journey 4 hours after passing B, and B finishes its journey 9 hours after passing A. What were their speeds?</p>

